1
00:00:48,920 --> 00:00:49,799
It's a sealing door.

2
00:00:49,840 --> 00:00:50,719
Seal the door!

3
00:00:51,240 --> 00:00:53,240
They want to trap us like dumpling filling.

4
00:01:01,240 --> 00:01:02,600
Fill it in properly!

5
00:01:02,960 --> 00:01:04,640
I want him to stay underground

6
00:01:04,920 --> 00:01:07,040
and truly be the master of this tomb.

7
00:01:13,040 --> 00:01:14,519
Is there a way forward?

8
00:01:14,560 --> 00:01:15,200
Funny you should ask.

9
00:01:15,319 --> 00:01:16,519
I've been down this passage twice.

10
00:01:16,519 --> 00:01:17,680
But its layout is quite bizarre.

11
00:01:17,760 --> 00:01:18,959
Shu, bring out the gear.

12
00:01:18,959 --> 00:01:20,159
Let's see if there's another way out.

13
00:01:20,159 --> 00:01:20,760
Scout ahead.

14
00:01:43,319 --> 00:01:44,319
A tunnel this long...

15
00:01:44,359 --> 00:01:45,680
leads to the Hall of the King of Hell?

16
00:01:45,680 --> 00:01:46,560
Building a tunnel this long

17
00:01:46,560 --> 00:01:47,359
violates standard design.

18
00:01:47,680 --> 00:01:48,840
They must be trying to hide something.

19
00:01:48,959 --> 00:01:49,959
I don't believe this.

20
00:01:59,519 --> 00:02:00,480
Shu, give me a hand.

21
00:02:05,680 --> 00:02:06,400
Tiankun.

22
00:02:06,599 --> 00:02:07,799
Is Zhang Tianyou dealt with?

23
00:02:07,799 --> 00:02:08,639
Don't worry, Mother.

24
00:02:08,960 --> 00:02:09,919
I buried him alive.

25
00:02:10,280 --> 00:02:11,840
Dad even praised me for a clean job.

26
00:02:14,400 --> 00:02:15,919
You can't let your guard down.

27
00:02:16,479 --> 00:02:18,759
What you did beneath the Sheng Family...

28
00:02:19,000 --> 00:02:20,840
must be buried deep in your heart.

29
00:02:21,240 --> 00:02:22,479
You absolutely cannot let it slip.

30
00:02:22,479 --> 00:02:24,240
Mother, of course I know.

31
00:02:26,240 --> 00:02:27,800
With your brother like this,

32
00:02:28,159 --> 00:02:31,960
the Qi Family Head position will be yours.

33
00:02:56,840 --> 00:02:57,680
Ting'er.

34
00:02:58,360 --> 00:02:59,759
It's been so long.

35
00:02:59,759 --> 00:03:02,199
You... you should be used to it by now.

36
00:03:04,159 --> 00:03:04,960
Dad.

37
00:03:06,800 --> 00:03:09,879
I'll be a cripple from now on.

38
00:03:10,319 --> 00:03:13,680
Can I still be the Qi Family Head?

39
00:03:18,479 --> 00:03:19,240
Ting'er,

40
00:03:19,240 --> 00:03:20,759
I have some good news for you.

41
00:03:20,919 --> 00:03:22,120
Earlier today,

42
00:03:22,120 --> 00:03:24,080
your brother had that bastard

43
00:03:24,080 --> 00:03:26,599
live-in son-in-law sealed alive below.

44
00:03:27,360 --> 00:03:27,919
From now on,

45
00:03:27,919 --> 00:03:30,639
Sheng Family wealth goes to the Qi Family.

46
00:03:30,680 --> 00:03:31,680
I've already thought it through.

47
00:03:31,680 --> 00:03:32,759
You and your brother

48
00:03:32,759 --> 00:03:34,080
will each get half.

49
00:03:34,240 --> 00:03:35,560
Each get half?

50
00:03:36,479 --> 00:03:37,719
Dad, do you even know...

51
00:03:38,199 --> 00:03:39,759
Just hear me out.

52
00:03:40,280 --> 00:03:42,280
Look at the state you're in now.

53
00:03:42,400 --> 00:03:43,120
Right?

54
00:03:43,800 --> 00:03:45,240
After I die,

55
00:03:45,319 --> 00:03:46,599
your brother will handle external affairs,

56
00:03:46,599 --> 00:03:47,680
and you'll handle internal ones.

57
00:03:47,759 --> 00:03:48,560
Right?

58
00:03:49,400 --> 00:03:51,560
I won't treat you poorly.

59
00:03:51,800 --> 00:03:53,000
It's just a pity

60
00:03:53,000 --> 00:03:56,199
we let Zhang Tianyou die so easily.

61
00:03:56,400 --> 00:03:57,439
He should've

62
00:03:57,719 --> 00:04:01,080
suffered a thousand cuts and gone to hell.

63
00:04:01,639 --> 00:04:02,680
Let me tell you,

64
00:04:02,680 --> 00:04:04,120
sealing him underground...

65
00:04:04,120 --> 00:04:05,560
was too good for him.

66
00:04:05,599 --> 00:04:06,400
I...

67
00:04:07,560 --> 00:04:08,360
Ting'er!

68
00:04:09,199 --> 00:04:10,000
Ting'er!

69
00:04:12,080 --> 00:04:13,599
Master, it's a dead end.

70
00:04:27,800 --> 00:04:29,199
This sealing dirt was added later.

71
00:04:29,199 --> 00:04:30,279
It's empty behind it.

72
00:04:31,000 --> 00:04:31,680
What,

73
00:04:31,680 --> 00:04:32,600
out of practice with loose dirt?

74
00:04:32,600 --> 00:04:33,680
You couldn't even tell?

75
00:04:34,480 --> 00:04:35,319
Miss Mei,

76
00:04:36,160 --> 00:04:37,480
you're the expert at fighting.

77
00:04:37,560 --> 00:04:38,240
But when it comes to digging holes,

78
00:04:39,560 --> 00:04:41,480
let's show her what we do best.

79
00:04:43,360 --> 00:04:43,920
Hold this.

80
00:04:44,839 --> 00:04:46,600
Dragons beget dragons, phoenixes the same,

81
00:04:46,720 --> 00:04:48,319
and a rat's son knows how to dig.

82
00:04:48,959 --> 00:04:49,759
Watch and learn.

83
00:04:50,199 --> 00:04:51,399
Tianting,

84
00:04:53,639 --> 00:04:54,240
you...

85
00:04:54,720 --> 00:04:55,639
How about this?

86
00:04:55,639 --> 00:04:57,680
Your brother gets forty, you get sixty.

87
00:04:57,680 --> 00:04:58,959
Are you happy now?

88
00:05:06,439 --> 00:05:07,680
Tianting,

89
00:05:07,920 --> 00:05:10,519
what do I have to do to satisfy you?

90
00:05:10,839 --> 00:05:12,360
I don't want money.

91
00:05:12,360 --> 00:05:14,480
I want the person who ruined my leg...

92
00:05:14,480 --> 00:05:15,800
...to suffer an even worse fate.

93
00:05:15,800 --> 00:05:17,040
Fine, fine, fine, fine, fine!

94
00:05:17,279 --> 00:05:18,600
I promise you, alright?

95
00:05:19,040 --> 00:05:20,720
I'll dig that bastard out,

96
00:05:20,720 --> 00:05:22,199
and deliver him right to you.

97
00:05:22,199 --> 00:05:23,319
I'll let you whip his corpse.

98
00:05:23,319 --> 00:05:25,319
Let you take it all out on him, okay?

99
00:05:31,879 --> 00:05:32,959
Wait, Ting!

100
00:05:32,959 --> 00:05:34,439
Be careful!

101
00:05:40,920 --> 00:05:41,759
Dad!

102
00:05:42,439 --> 00:05:43,360
There's something...

103
00:05:43,360 --> 00:05:44,279
There's something under the bed.

104
00:05:44,279 --> 00:05:45,040
What is it?

105
00:05:45,040 --> 00:05:46,279
Y-y-you... look!

106
00:06:00,160 --> 00:06:01,000
Zhang Tianyou

107
00:06:01,000 --> 00:06:01,519
What's going on?

108
00:06:01,519 --> 00:06:02,480
It's you again.

109
00:06:04,759 --> 00:06:05,560
Dad, he's not...

110
00:06:05,800 --> 00:06:06,639
Sorry about that.

111
00:06:06,639 --> 00:06:07,639
Excuse me.

112
00:06:07,920 --> 00:06:08,639
Quick, get someone!

113
00:06:08,639 --> 00:06:09,480
Go get someone!

114
00:06:09,759 --> 00:06:10,639
I'll get someone.

115
00:06:10,759 --> 00:06:11,360
Right, right, right.

116
00:06:11,360 --> 00:06:12,360
I forgot, I forgot.

117
00:06:12,399 --> 00:06:14,120
Somebody!

118
00:06:14,120 --> 00:06:15,920
Somebody, come quick!

119
00:06:15,920 --> 00:06:16,759
Hurry!

120
00:06:16,920 --> 00:06:18,160
Somebody, hurry!

121
00:06:18,279 --> 00:06:18,879
This...

122
00:06:22,680 --> 00:06:23,839
Why are you helping him?

123
00:06:23,839 --> 00:06:25,279
Grab Zhang Tianyou!

124
00:06:26,360 --> 00:06:28,480
Master Qi, look who this is.

125
00:06:28,839 --> 00:06:29,839
Hello, Uncle Qi.

126
00:06:31,160 --> 00:06:35,680
Wanna kill me again in front of Miss Mei?

127
00:06:35,680 --> 00:06:37,800
Or do you want to talk?

128
00:06:37,800 --> 00:06:39,240
Twenty years ago,

129
00:06:39,680 --> 00:06:41,519
in the Tidal Tomb,

130
00:06:41,519 --> 00:06:43,240
just how many secrets did you bury?

131
00:06:43,240 --> 00:06:44,040
You...

132
00:06:47,399 --> 00:06:48,560
Take him away!

133
00:06:49,079 --> 00:06:50,199
Take him away!

134
00:06:50,720 --> 00:06:51,319
Wait...

135
00:06:51,639 --> 00:06:52,680
It's fine. You step down first.

136
00:06:52,680 --> 00:06:53,800
Drag the young master out.

137
00:06:54,879 --> 00:06:56,439
You step down first.

138
00:06:56,600 --> 00:06:57,120
Can't I listen too?

139
00:06:57,120 --> 00:06:57,720
Right, just hurry up and step down.

140
00:06:57,920 --> 00:06:58,519
But...

141
00:06:59,160 --> 00:07:00,000
Easy, easy, easy!

142
00:07:09,240 --> 00:07:10,160
Qi Lianhai,

143
00:07:11,040 --> 00:07:12,560
the Sheng Family's Earth Vein Sutra,

144
00:07:12,560 --> 00:07:14,519
and Mei Family's Celestial Seal are here.

145
00:07:15,040 --> 00:07:17,800
Hand over the Qi Family's Talisman Book.

146
00:07:17,879 --> 00:07:20,480
The Fifteenth Night is in a few days.

147
00:07:20,480 --> 00:07:22,120
I don't need you to remind me.

148
00:07:23,560 --> 00:07:25,800
I know about what happened twenty years ago

149
00:07:25,800 --> 00:07:27,480
better than you do.

150
00:07:27,480 --> 00:07:28,680
Alright.

151
00:07:28,680 --> 00:07:30,199
Since you know it all,

152
00:07:30,480 --> 00:07:33,279
why don't we clear things up tonight?

153
00:07:33,639 --> 00:07:35,600
Back then, in the Tidal Tomb,

154
00:07:36,360 --> 00:07:37,959
what exactly happened?

155
00:07:38,759 --> 00:07:39,399
The secret from back then,

156
00:07:39,399 --> 00:07:40,519
who told you about it?

157
00:07:40,680 --> 00:07:43,000
The Sheng Family or your Mei Family?

158
00:07:43,000 --> 00:07:44,319
Don't worry about that.

159
00:07:44,600 --> 00:07:46,000
Just tell us.

160
00:07:46,319 --> 00:07:48,240
Besides The Four Great Families,

161
00:07:48,720 --> 00:07:51,399
was the Dragon-Seeking Zhang Family there?

162
00:07:54,319 --> 00:07:57,399
The Dragon-Seeking Zhang Family died out.

163
00:07:57,959 --> 00:07:59,120
If you have any questions,

164
00:07:59,120 --> 00:08:01,199
go ask them in the underworld!

165
00:08:03,519 --> 00:08:05,120
For over twenty years,

166
00:08:05,120 --> 00:08:08,120
that evil thing has tormented us enough.

167
00:08:09,560 --> 00:08:11,519
And now,

168
00:08:11,519 --> 00:08:14,360
without Zhang's Dragon-Seeking Formula,

169
00:08:14,720 --> 00:08:17,480
no one will ever find the Tidal Tomb.

170
00:08:18,519 --> 00:08:19,319
You, get out.

171
00:08:20,199 --> 00:08:24,680
I want to speak with the Mei girl alone.

172
00:08:36,080 --> 00:08:37,679
Speak your mind, Uncle Qi.

173
00:08:38,159 --> 00:08:39,759
I just don't understand.

174
00:08:40,480 --> 00:08:43,039
Mei Family girl, why are you with him?

175
00:08:43,080 --> 00:08:44,519
It's like this, Uncle Qi.

176
00:08:44,720 --> 00:08:46,639
Even without the Dragon-Seeking lineage,

177
00:08:47,039 --> 00:08:48,080
electing a Chief,

178
00:08:48,120 --> 00:08:50,639
uniting the Talisman, Curse, Seal, and Eye

179
00:08:50,840 --> 00:08:52,879
to fight it is still better than

180
00:08:52,879 --> 00:08:54,039
leaving things as they are

181
00:08:54,279 --> 00:08:56,279
and letting the Sheng Family tragedy repeat.

182
00:08:56,279 --> 00:08:57,080
Wait.

183
00:08:58,200 --> 00:09:02,159
Even if your so-called Chief finds it,

184
00:09:02,159 --> 00:09:03,919
and destroys it,

185
00:09:03,919 --> 00:09:04,639
what happens then?

186
00:09:04,639 --> 00:09:06,840
Naturally, the Chief's family

187
00:09:06,840 --> 00:09:08,159
will keep Talisman, Curse, Seal, and Eye.

188
00:09:08,559 --> 00:09:10,399
They can't remain scattered like now.

189
00:09:12,440 --> 00:09:14,320
After all this beating around the bush,

190
00:09:14,639 --> 00:09:16,320
I finally get it.

191
00:09:16,600 --> 00:09:19,879
Sheng and Mei Families rushed for a

192
00:09:20,039 --> 00:09:23,759
live-in son-in-law just to swallow us up!

193
00:09:24,679 --> 00:09:26,279
In your dreams!

194
00:09:36,519 --> 00:09:37,720
Leave.

195
00:09:42,559 --> 00:09:44,600
I really underestimated you.

196
00:09:44,759 --> 00:09:47,399
You're still living off the Sheng Family,

197
00:09:47,639 --> 00:09:49,399
now you're reaching for the Mei's bowl.

198
00:09:49,399 --> 00:09:52,399
Maybe I'm just cut out for it.

199
00:09:52,399 --> 00:09:53,480
Cut the crap.

200
00:09:53,679 --> 00:09:54,759
Let's work together.

201
00:09:55,879 --> 00:09:57,960
Help me become the Family Head.

202
00:09:58,519 --> 00:10:01,320
Resources of the Qi, Mei, and Sheng...

203
00:10:02,240 --> 00:10:03,399
we'll share them.

204
00:10:04,360 --> 00:10:05,360
Young Master Qi,

205
00:10:05,360 --> 00:10:07,039
you're already the heir apparent.

206
00:10:07,039 --> 00:10:09,480
Need my help to become the Family Head?

207
00:10:13,000 --> 00:10:13,519
Right.

208
00:10:13,519 --> 00:10:14,440
Well, about that...

209
00:10:14,440 --> 00:10:16,519
Sorry, I forgot.

210
00:10:22,840 --> 00:10:24,440
We can either work together for a win-win,

211
00:10:25,120 --> 00:10:26,039
or...

212
00:10:27,799 --> 00:10:31,279
my dad and I will kill you at any cost.

213
00:10:32,679 --> 00:10:33,919
The choice is yours.

214
00:10:40,960 --> 00:10:42,559
When I'm thinking about a problem,

215
00:10:42,559 --> 00:10:44,279
could you not stare at me?

216
00:10:44,480 --> 00:10:45,840
Why don't you step outside for a bit?

217
00:10:52,000 --> 00:10:53,279
This is my house!

218
00:10:53,320 --> 00:10:55,000
Besides, how am I supposed to leave?

219
00:10:55,000 --> 00:10:56,399
I'll go outside and think about it.

220
00:11:06,120 --> 00:11:07,639
That Li Xiao you asked me to investigate...

221
00:11:07,840 --> 00:11:09,480
is dirtier than either of us thought.

222
00:11:10,120 --> 00:11:11,840
Compared to The Four Great Families,

223
00:11:11,840 --> 00:11:13,679
they have absolutely no reverence.

224
00:11:13,960 --> 00:11:15,120
So...

225
00:11:15,120 --> 00:11:17,159
you're here to persuade me to back down.

226
00:11:17,799 --> 00:11:19,399
I'm here to give you a warning.

227
00:11:19,399 --> 00:11:21,759
And to bring you a small gift.

228
00:11:24,919 --> 00:11:27,840
My people followed Li Xiao's trail...

229
00:11:28,279 --> 00:11:30,440
and dug up that 20-year-old case.

230
00:11:30,960 --> 00:11:32,039
And guess what?

231
00:11:32,639 --> 00:11:35,080
The renowned Wan, Mei, Qi, and Sheng...

232
00:11:35,240 --> 00:11:38,320
were just doing dirty digging work.

233
00:11:38,759 --> 00:11:41,519
How did they suddenly become elites

234
00:11:41,919 --> 00:11:44,679
holding Talisman, Curse, Seal, and Eye?

235
00:11:45,320 --> 00:11:46,240
Zhang Tianyou,

236
00:11:46,480 --> 00:11:48,480
this rags-to-riches tale...

237
00:11:49,039 --> 00:11:50,440
you must be quite familiar with it.

238
00:11:53,519 --> 00:11:54,919
Alright, put it on.

239
00:11:59,799 --> 00:12:01,000
That was a good story.

240
00:12:02,840 --> 00:12:03,639
What else?

241
00:12:03,840 --> 00:12:05,919
Those who joined The Four Great Families...

242
00:12:05,919 --> 00:12:07,480
included the Dragon-Seeking Zhang Family.

243
00:12:08,440 --> 00:12:11,440
You've tried so hard to find that tomb...

244
00:12:13,039 --> 00:12:14,879
isn't this what you want to find out?

245
00:12:16,879 --> 00:12:19,679
Chief Leng is truly resourceful.

246
00:12:20,679 --> 00:12:21,440
But...

247
00:12:22,679 --> 00:12:24,080
knowing too much...

248
00:12:24,360 --> 00:12:27,600
Sand-Turning Gang's good days are over.

249
00:12:29,240 --> 00:12:30,519
You still need to help me find...

250
00:12:31,480 --> 00:12:33,519
the tomb with Qi Family's Talisman Book.

251
00:12:36,600 --> 00:12:40,480
The Mei Family only wants warlord backing.

252
00:12:41,000 --> 00:12:43,600
And now they've sent out a little girl.

253
00:12:44,440 --> 00:12:46,720
What game are they playing?

254
00:12:46,720 --> 00:12:48,639
Dad, if you ask me,

255
00:12:48,639 --> 00:12:50,200
if we want to beat the deadline...

256
00:12:50,200 --> 00:12:51,559
and destroy the monsters in the tomb,

257
00:12:51,559 --> 00:12:53,399
our Qi Family should take the lead.

258
00:12:53,399 --> 00:12:55,279
I have the same idea.

259
00:12:55,320 --> 00:12:57,320
But our Qi Family only has sons.

260
00:12:57,320 --> 00:12:59,679
We can't get a live-in son-in-law.

261
00:13:02,240 --> 00:13:03,039
Dad,

262
00:13:03,679 --> 00:13:06,080
the Mei Family could find any son-in-law.

263
00:13:06,279 --> 00:13:07,759
Why does it have to be that kid?

264
00:13:07,759 --> 00:13:08,840
Isn't it obvious?

265
00:13:09,159 --> 00:13:10,600
It's about his chart to

266
00:13:10,600 --> 00:13:13,720
ward off calamities and absorb malevolence

267
00:13:15,279 --> 00:13:16,759
Logically speaking,

268
00:13:17,279 --> 00:13:20,039
this is vital for The Four Great Families.

269
00:13:20,639 --> 00:13:23,120
They shouldn't have just sent a girl...

270
00:13:23,120 --> 00:13:24,399
to handle this alone.

271
00:13:25,000 --> 00:13:26,799
Something fishy is definitely going on.

272
00:13:27,159 --> 00:13:28,000
Tianting,

273
00:13:28,080 --> 00:13:31,080
send someone to look into Mei Jiushuang.

274
00:13:32,080 --> 00:13:32,879
Dad.

275
00:13:32,960 --> 00:13:34,639
And the Sheng's live-in son-in-law?

276
00:13:34,639 --> 00:13:35,879
What are you going to do about him?

277
00:13:38,000 --> 00:13:38,799
Come here.

278
00:13:38,840 --> 00:13:39,639
Come here.

279
00:13:42,879 --> 00:13:43,720
I'll tell you.

280
00:13:50,960 --> 00:13:51,600
Dad.

281
00:13:51,600 --> 00:13:52,960
Why are you so devious?

282
00:13:52,960 --> 00:13:54,159
I'll beat you to death, you brat!
